<main class="tp-page">
 <section class="tp-wrap tp-hero"><div><div class="tp-ey">Tire pressure monitoring</div><h1 class="tp-title">TPMS service & sensor replacement near you</h1><p class="tp-copy">Your tire-pressure monitoring system helps alert you when a tire needs attention. We diagnose TPMS warning lights, inspect sensors, and provide the service needed to restore clear, dependable monitoring.</p><a class="tp-btn" href="#tp-book">Request an appointment →</a></div><img src="{{ 'ats-inline-68.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Technician servicing a tire pressure monitoring sensor"></section>
 <section class="tp-sec tp-alt"><div class="tp-wrap tp-grid2"><article class="tp-panel"><div class="tp-ey">Signs to watch for</div><h3>Does your TPMS need attention?</h3><p>A TPMS light can mean low pressure, a sensor issue, or a system that needs diagnosis.</p><ul class="tp-list"><li>TPMS warning light is on</li><li>Light returns after tires are inflated</li><li>Tire pressure readings seem inaccurate</li><li>A tire sensor was recently replaced</li></ul></article><article class="tp-panel"><div class="tp-ey">Precision service</div><h3>What’s included in TPMS service?</h3><p>We check the monitoring system and explain the recommendation before service begins.</p><ul class="tp-list"><li>TPMS system diagnosis and scan</li><li>Pressure and sensor inspection</li><li>Sensor service or replacement when needed</li><li>System reset and road-test verification</li></ul></article></div></section>
 <section class="tp-sec tp-dark"><div class="tp-wrap tp-center"><div class="tp-ey">Good to know</div><h2 class="tp-title">TPMS service — how often you need it and what it costs</h2><p class="tp-copy">TPMS sensors have batteries and components that wear over time. A diagnostic check identifies whether the light is caused by air pressure, a sensor, or another system concern.</p><div class="tp-grid3" style="margin-top:27px"><article class="tp-panel"><h3>Any warning light</h3><p>Have the system checked promptly so you know what your vehicle is telling you.</p></article><article class="tp-panel"><h3>New tires</h3><p>We can inspect and service compatible TPMS components during tire installation.</p></article><article class="tp-panel"><h3>Sensor concerns</h3><p>Sensor service is recommended when readings are missing, inconsistent, or incorrect.</p></article></div></div></section>
 <section class="tp-sec"><div class="tp-wrap tp-center"><div class="tp-ey">How booking works</div><h2 class="tp-title">From request to back on the road</h2><div class="tp-grid4" style="margin-top:27px"><article class="tp-panel tp-step"><b>1</b><h3>Request online</h3><p>Choose your preferred store.</p></article><article class="tp-panel tp-step"><b>2</b><h3>Check in</h3><p>Tell us when your warning light appeared.</p></article><article class="tp-panel tp-step"><b>3</b><h3>Inspect & diagnose</h3><p>We check tire pressure and the TPMS system.</p></article><article class="tp-panel tp-step"><b>4</b><h3>Back on the road</h3><p>Receive clear results and service guidance.</p></article></div></div></section>
 <section class="tp-sec tp-alt"><div class="tp-wrap tp-split"><img src="{{ 'ats-inline-68.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="TPMS service at American Tire Stores"><div><div class="tp-ey">Why it matters</div><h2 class="tp-title">Why TPMS service matters</h2><p class="tp-copy">Your TPMS is designed to let you know when tire pressure may affect handling, tire life, and efficiency. A reliable system gives you the information needed to respond before a small issue becomes a larger one.</p><ul class="tp-list"><li>Helps you respond to low tire pressure early</li><li>Supports more even tire wear</li><li>Helps protect handling and fuel efficiency</li><li>Restores confidence in your dashboard warning system</li></ul></div></div></section>
 <section class="tp-sec"><div class="tp-wrap tp-center"><div class="tp-ey">Know your system</div><h2 class="tp-title">Direct vs. indirect TPMS and why it matters</h2><p class="tp-copy">Your vehicle may use sensors inside each wheel or monitor wheel-speed data to detect pressure changes. Our team can identify the system fitted to your vehicle.</p><div class="tp-grid3" style="margin-top:27px"><article class="tp-panel"><h3>Direct TPMS</h3><p>Uses a sensor in each wheel to measure and report tire pressure.</p></article><article class="tp-panel"><h3>Indirect TPMS</h3><p>Uses vehicle systems to detect differences that may indicate a pressure change.</p></article><article class="tp-panel"><h3>Sensor lifecycle</h3><p>Sensor batteries and seals wear over time, so diagnosis identifies the right next step.</p></article></div></div></section>
 <section class="tp-sec tp-dark"><div class="tp-wrap tp-center"><div class="tp-ey">Quality you can trust</div><h2 class="tp-title">Quality TPMS sensors, every time</h2><p class="tp-copy">We use service procedures and components suited to your vehicle, then confirm the monitoring system is communicating correctly.</p><div class="tp-grid3" style="margin-top:27px"><article class="tp-panel"><h3>Professional diagnosis</h3><p>We identify the cause before recommending a repair.</p></article><article class="tp-panel"><h3>Vehicle-compatible service</h3><p>Service and replacement are matched to your vehicle’s needs.</p></article><article class="tp-panel"><h3>Clear communication</h3><p>Your advisor explains results and recommended next steps.</p></article></div></div></section>
 <section class="tp-sec tp-alt"><div class="tp-wrap tp-split"><img src="{{ 'ats-inline-67.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Customer discussing service options"><div><div class="tp-ey">Straightforward options</div><h2 class="tp-title">What does TPMS service cost?</h2><p class="tp-copy">The right solution depends on the cause of the warning light and your vehicle’s system. Choose a store to request service and your advisor can confirm recommendations and pricing. Financing is available for qualifying customers.</p><a class="tp-btn" href="/pages/financing">Explore financing →</a></div></div></section>
 <section class="tp-sec tp-dark" id="tp-book"><div class="tp-wrap tp-center"><div class="tp-ey">Request an appointment</div><h2 class="tp-title">Book TPMS service at your store</h2><p class="tp-copy">Choose your nearby location to begin a TPMS service request.</p><div class="tp-book-panel"><div class="tp-book-row"><select id="tp-store" aria-label="Choose a store"><option value="">Choose your store</option><option value="52820">Ventura</option><option value="52819">Thousand Oaks</option><option value="52819">Valencia</option><option value="61758">Hollywood</option><option value="52816">Glendale</option><option value="52818">Glendale 2</option><option value="52814">Bellflower</option><option value="52814">Costa Mesa</option><option value="52815">Cathedral City</option></select><button type="button" class="tp-btn" onclick="window.startTpmsBooking()">Request TPMS service →</button></div><div id="tp-widget" class="tp-widget">Choose a store above to begin your TPMS service request.</div></div></div></section>
 <section class="tp-sec"><div class="tp-wrap tp-center"><div class="tp-ey">Why American Tire Stores</div><h2 class="tp-title">Service Southern California drivers trust</h2><div class="tp-grid3" style="margin-top:27px"><article class="tp-panel tp-review"><div class="tp-stars">★★★★★</div><p>“The warning light was diagnosed quickly and the team explained exactly what needed attention.”</p><b>American Tire Stores customer</b></article><article class="tp-panel tp-review"><div class="tp-stars">★★★★★</div><p>“They checked my tires and sensors, reset the system, and made the next steps easy to understand.”</p><b>American Tire Stores customer</b></article><article class="tp-panel tp-review"><div class="tp-stars">★★★★★</div><p>“Professional service and no pressure—just a clear solution for my TPMS warning.”</p><b>American Tire Stores customer</b></article></div></div></section>
 <section class="tp-sec tp-alt"><div class="tp-wrap tp-center"><div class="tp-ey">Near you</div><h2 class="tp-title">TPMS service near you, across Southern California</h2><p class="tp-copy">TPMS diagnostics and related tire service are available at all American Tire Stores locations.</p><div class="tp-locs"><article class="tp-loc"><h3>Ventura</h3><p>5100 Telegraph Rd<br>(805) 644-3330</p><a href="/pages/location-ventura-ca">Store details →</a></article><article class="tp-loc"><h3>Thousand Oaks</h3><p>621 E Thousand Oaks Blvd<br>(805) 379-1910</p><a href="/pages/location-thousand-oaks-ca">Store details →</a></article><article class="tp-loc"><h3>Valencia</h3><p>23510 Valencia Blvd, Unit A<br>(661) 596-1444</p><a href="/pages/location-valencia-ca">Store details →</a></article><article class="tp-loc"><h3>Hollywood</h3><p>1174 N Western Ave<br>(323) 372-9372</p><a href="/pages/location-hollywood-ca">Store details →</a></article><article class="tp-loc"><h3>Glendale</h3><p>737 S Glendale Ave<br>(818) 243-3191</p><a href="/pages/location-glendale-ca">Store details →</a></article><article class="tp-loc"><h3>Glendale 2</h3><p>1130 S Central Ave<br>(818) 547-2010</p><a href="/pages/location-glendale-ii-ca">Store details →</a></article><article class="tp-loc"><h3>Bellflower</h3><p>9509 Alondra Blvd<br>(562) 804-4737</p><a href="/pages/location-bellflower-ca">Store details →</a></article><article class="tp-loc"><h3>Costa Mesa</h3><p>2049 Harbor Blvd<br>(949) 802-6419</p><a href="/pages/location-costa-mesa-ca">Store details →</a></article><article class="tp-loc"><h3>Cathedral City</h3><p>68406 E Palm Canyon Dr<br>(760) 469-9510</p><a href="/pages/location-cathedral-city-ca">Store details →</a></article></div></div></section>
 <section class="tp-sec"><div class="tp-wrap tp-center"><div class="tp-ey">More services</div><h2 class="tp-title">Related auto services</h2><div class="tp-grid3 tp-related" style="margin-top:27px"><article class="tp-panel"><img src="{{ 'ats-inline-64.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Wheel alignment"><div class="tp-rbody"><h3>Wheel alignment</h3><p>Support even tire wear and stable steering.</p><a href="/pages/service-wheel-alignment">Learn more →</a></div></article><article class="tp-panel"><img src="{{ 'ats-inline-65.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Brake service"><div class="tp-rbody"><h3>Brake service</h3><p>Keep your braking system ready for the road.</p><a href="/pages/service-brake-repair">Learn more →</a></div></article><article class="tp-panel"><img src="{{ 'ats-inline-66.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Tire installation"><div class="tp-rbody"><h3>Tire installation</h3><p>Find tires that fit and arrange professional installation.</p><a href="/pages/tire-search">Shop tires →</a></div></article></div></div></section>
 <section class="tp-sec tp-alt"><div class="tp-wrap tp-center"><div class="tp-ey">Good to know</div><h2 class="tp-title">TPMS service FAQ</h2><div class="tp-faq"><details><summary>What does the TPMS warning light mean?</summary><p>It may indicate low tire pressure, a sensor issue, or a monitoring-system concern. A diagnostic check identifies the cause.</p></details><details><summary>Can I drive with the TPMS light on?</summary><p>Check your tire pressure as soon as it is safe to do so and arrange service if the light remains on or returns.</p></details><details><summary>How long does TPMS service take?</summary><p>Service time depends on the cause and vehicle. Your selected store can confirm timing when you request an appointment.</p></details><details><summary>Do TPMS sensors need to be replaced?</summary><p>Sensors may need service or replacement when their batteries or components reach the end of their useful life.</p></details><details><summary>Is an appointment required?</summary><p>An appointment is recommended so the store can prepare for your vehicle and confirm availability.</p></details></div></div></section>
 <section class="tp-final"><div class="tp-wrap"><div class="tp-ey">Keep an eye on your tires</div><h2 class="tp-title">Ready to clear that TPMS light?</h2><p class="tp-copy">Request your appointment with a nearby American Tire Stores location today.</p><a class="tp-btn" href="#tp-book">Request an appointment →</a></div></section>
</main>
